> Combining these might be ... interesting.

Abusing wizmode,

---
You were turning to stone.
You were turning into slime.
You were held by a rope golem.
---

at the same time wasn't so difficult, and I can imagine it as a rather 
trivial (though slightly dangerous) 'ascension trick' with a few wishes. 
But "sick from food poisoning" proved slightly more work, I couldn't 
come up with any way of "instant food poisoning" even in wizmode. 
Wishing up cursed food/corpses didn't do it, and zombie/mummy corpses 
weren't wishable in vanilla (in Slashem they can be wished up, but then 
they still seem to require aging). So I had to just naturally age a 
corpse - what troubles one has to go to... So if you want to ascend with 
food poisoning, plan ahead!

The wizmode CTRL-X screen also fooled me by not reporting anything about 
food poisoning, even though FoodPois was on the status line.

Most Attributes on Ascension could be a nice addition to the Most Types 
of Deaths class of Nethack feats.. :)


